Ground zero to expert in dagger is 6 slots.  Didn't you mention
being XL 13 at the moment?  That's only half of your allotment.

My general observation is that early in the game leveling up
happens faster than getting enough hits to enhance weapons.
An active dagger thrower can end up expert in dagger around
XP 9 or so around the time killing monsters takes so much
effort the level increases slow dramatically.  That still leaves a
couple of levels for other stuff.

